  "prefLabel": "He-W 549.08 Utilization Review and Control",
  "recordType": "rule-section",
  "ruleText": "He-W 549.08 Utilization Review and Control. The department shall monitor utilization of HVNH and child/family health care support services, in accordance with 42 CFR 455, 42 CFR 456, and He-W 520.\n\nSource. #7775, eff 10-8-02; ss by #9768, eff 10-8-10; ss by #10092, eff 3-1-12 (from He-W 549.07)",
